BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_716314b3-66af-4ef8-9560-44b0f62f0c80.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
